{"id":"5026751112f75f31","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-finite-model.md","title":"GL Finite Model","display":"df-gl-finite-model — GL Finite Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-finite-model","aliases":["89-df-gl-finite-model"],"display":"df-gl-finite-model — GL Finite Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-finite-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-finite-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-finite-model — GL Finite Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of Kripke models\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\">\\(M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are the predicates from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W_M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W_M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 参数避免把所有集合大小模型组成的真类伪装成集合。</li>\n<li>GL有限模型是世界集有限且底层框架为 GL 框架的 Kripke 模型</li>\n<li>GL有限模型用于判定算法</li>\n<li>GL有限模型是 FMP 的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U$ is a set of Kripke models\n$M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)$ (see [[89-df-kripke-model]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are the predicates from\n[[89-df-gl-frame]] and [[89-df-finite]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are the predicates from\n[[89-df-gl-frame]] and [[89-df-finite]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W_M)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":995,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]"}],"outgoing":["9cd755e57aea2c47","c6ab46cd662b1409","ab746eb779e20ce0"]}